<title>CHILE: Chile's Mantos Blancos 1996 net climbs.</title>
<headline>Chile's Mantos Blancos 1996 net climbs.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Copper mining company Empresa Minera de Mantos Blancos SA reported the following results in 1996.</p>
<p>				1996		 1995</p>
<p> Net earnings		31.8		  7.6</p>
<p> Operating income	  40.1		 23.5</p>
<p> Non-operating loss	-1.8		-13.6</p>
<p> Total revenues	   235.5		159.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Mantos Blancos is the only large copper producer trading on Santiago bolsa. It is 75 percent owned by Minorco .</p>
<p>All figures are in millions of dollars.</p>
</text>
